<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Details of Hyperparameter</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In this section, we put details of hyperparameters of training for Duo, SDDLM, SDDLM-V1, SDDLM-V2 in Table <a href="#A1.T2" title="Table 2 ‣ Appendix A Details of Hyperparameter ‣ Simple Denoising Diffusion Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>. We follow the settings used in Duo for fair comparison.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.T2" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A1.T2.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 2</span>: </span><span id="A1.T2.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Training Hyperparameters.</span></figcaption>
<table id="A1.T2.5" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A1.T2.5.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T2.5.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt"><span id="A1.T2.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Hyperparameter</span></td>
<td id="A1.T2.5.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt"><span id="A1.T2.5.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Duo</span></td>
<td id="A1.T2.5.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt"><span id="A1.T2.5.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">SDDLM</span></td>
<td id="A1.T2.5.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt"><span id="A1.T2.5.1.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">SDDLM-V1</span></td>
<td id="A1.T2.5.1.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt"><span id="A1.T2.5.1.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">SDDLM-V2</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T2.5.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T2.5.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">Optimizer</td>
<td id="A1.T2.5.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">AdamW</td>
<td id="A1.T2.5.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">AdamW</td>
<td id="A1.T2.5.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">AdamW</td>
<td id="A1.T2.5.2.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">AdamW</td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T2.5.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T2.5.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Learning Rate</td>
<td id="A1.T2.5.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><math id="A1.T2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="3\times 10^{-4}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">3\times 10^{-4}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A1.T2.5.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><math id="A1.T2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="3\times 10^{-4}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">3\times 10^{-4}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A1.T2.5.3.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><math id="A1.T2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="3\times 10^{-4}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">3\times 10^{-4}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="A1.T2.5.3.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><math id="A1.T2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="3\times 10^{-4}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">3\times 10^{-4}</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T2.5.4" class="ltx_tr">
